; This devcontainer's base image is pinned to a specific Node LTS minor
; version (see docs/spec/development-environment.md), so its bundled
; headers at /usr/local/include/node always match the running Node.
; node-gyp's default fallback — downloading headers from nodejs.org — is
; unreachable from the auto-mode sandbox's egress-proxy allowlist
; (ADR-068), which blocks anything outside npm/GitHub/Anthropic. Pointing
; node-gyp at the local headers instead (needed by better-sqlite3, which
; has no prebuilt binary for this Node version yet) makes `npm install`
; work the same way in every instance of this pinned image, sandboxed or
; not.
nodedir=/usr/local
